# What the Docker build may see: the Go module and nothing else. Card 1032.
#
# The build stage copies the whole context, and a working tree here usually
# has pb_data/ beside it, with the database, the TLS key and the config. The
# final image never held them, but the daemon and its build cache did. A list
# of what is allowed rather than of what is not, so the next secret somebody
# leaves in the directory is kept out without anybody remembering to add it.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!*.go
